questions.scenario:
You are debugging a production issue where a high-throughput Spring Boot microservice continuously leaks memory until an `OutOfMemoryError: Metaspace` occurs. A code audit reveals the following class, which dynamically creates dynamic proxies for tenant routing on every incoming request:

java
@Service
public class TenantProxyFactory {
    public <T> T createTenantProxy(Class<T> interfaceClass, Object target) {
        ClassLoader tempLoader = new URLClassLoader(new URL[0], interfaceClass.getClassLoader());
        return (T) Proxy.newProxyInstance(
            tempLoader,
            new Class<?>[]{interfaceClass},
            new TenantInvocationHandler(target)
        );
    }
}
